:"\\bar y","status":"verified"},{"id":"formula:book3:L084:109","location":"blocks[4].value.inlineMath[0]","sourceString":"（1）$\\bar y=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n y_i=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n(x_i+b)=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i+b=\\bar x+b$，","latex":"\\bar y=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n y_i=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n(x_i+b)=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i+b=\\bar x+b","status":"verified"},{"id":"formula:book3:L084:110","location":"blocks[5].value.inlineMath[0]","sourceString":"$s_y^2=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n(y_i-\\bar y)^2=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n[(x_i+b)-(\\bar x+b)]^2=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n(x_i-\\bar x)^2=s_x^2$。","latex":"s_y^2=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n(y_i-\\bar y)^2=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n[(x_i+b)-(\\bar x+b)]^2=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n(x_i-\\bar x)^2=s_x^2","status":"verified"},{"id":"formula:book3:L084:111","location":"blocks[6].value.inlineMath[0]","sourceString":"（2）$\\bar y=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n y_i=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n(kx_i)=\\frac kn\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i=k\\bar x$，","latex":"\\bar y=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n y_i=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n(kx_i)=\\frac kn\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i=k\\bar x","status":"verified"},{"id":"formula:book3:L084:112","location":"blocks[7].value.inlineMath[0]","sourceString":"$s_y^2=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n(y_i-\\bar y)^2=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n(kx_i-k\\bar x)^2=\\frac{k^2}n\\sum_{i=1}^n(x_i-\\bar x)^2=k^2s_x^2$。","latex":"s_y^2=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n(y_i-\\bar y)^2=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n(kx_i-k\\bar x)^2=\\frac{k^2}n\\sum_{i=1}^n(x_i-\\bar x)^2=k^2s_x^2","status":"verified"}]},{"id":"lesson-content:book3:L084:TB-variance","nodeId":"atom:21173:1","proposedNodeId":null,"kind":"definition","origin":"textbook_verbatim","title":"样本数据的方差","scope":"教材对应概念的原句与公式，标题与范围为编辑索引。","blocks":[{"role":"statement","type":"text","value":"此外，在初中阶段我们已学习过用样本数据的方差","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L084:TB-variance"]},{"role":"statement","type":"text","value":"$s^2=\\frac{(x_1-\\bar x)^2+(x_2-\\bar x)^2+\\cdots+(x_n-\\bar x)^2}{n}=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n(x_i-\\bar x)^2$","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L084:TB-variance"]},{"role":"statement","